==Description==
The '''Lockdown Shutters''' is a common consumable exclusively used in [[PVP]] mode.

It can be used an unlimited number of times, but it costs {{Money|750}} to use each time. It has a 60 second cooldown, with an initial cooldown of 30.

==Usage==
When used, the '''Lockdown Shutters''' will block the exit of a team for two seconds, tanking all damage that would be done to the base health in that period.

==Appearance==
The '''Lockdown Shutters''' are a set of metal shutters which block the exit.

